  "disposition": "partial: target L4, met L1 good (the throughput floor now judged on CPU time, D1: 2.91 MB/CPU-s; wave 1b's 0.62 MB/s was wall clock under contention). L1 good, not excellent: sym_recall 0.8704 against universal-ctags 6.2.1 — ctags tags libuv's TEST_IMPL/BENCHMARK_IMPL macro uses as functions named by the macro. L2 unmet: scip-clang 0.4.0 calls now measurable (D5 enclosing-range fallback, 626 definitions): call_recall 0.846 good, call_precision 0.6047 vs .85, not root-caused this round. L4: typed_recall 0 — internal/scip.ImportIndex attributes a reference by its SCIP definition's enclosing_range, which scip-clang never sets, so `fathom ingest --scip` of a scip-clang index yields no typed edges (a product gap, not a bench one); def_mapping 0.2672. Trigger: ImportIndex gains the same mapped-definition line-span fallback, and an L2 pass classifies the unmatched call pairs."
